OL,3,AClean-up under way as Storm Boelo
OL,4,Aleaves thousands without power
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoelo is the second storm to have hit
OL,7,Fparts of the UK in recent days,
OL,8,Ffollowing Storm Austen which brought
OL,9,Fsimilar levels of disruption, while
OL,10,Fstrong winds and rain are forecast to
OL,11,Fcontinue on Monday.
